Today is 2026-11-17, and the athlete said "November fifteenth". The next time November 15 comes round is in 2027, so raceDate is 2027-11-15. It is not in the past. The athlete gave a calendar date, so I use raceDate and do not compute raceInWeeks.

This is a patch that fills in the race date. Holt's line should confirm briefly.

{"route": "patch", "say": "November 15th next year, got it. I'll build the block backwards from there.", "patch": {"raceDate": "2027-11-15"}}
